# Retained acceptance attempts: prune raw trees, keep phase-level helpers visible.
# Already-tracked curated evidence remains tracked. See acceptance/README.md.
/acceptance/*/*/
# Large phase-level preservation inventories are retained locally too.
/acceptance/pt8/preservation-before.json
/acceptance/pt8-workloads/preservation-baseline.json
